@startuml
!define NODE node
!define COMPONENT component
!define DATABASE database

skinparam monochrome true

NODE "Client Tier" {
    COMPONENT "Web Browser\n(Chrome/Firefox/Edge)" as Browser
}

NODE "Application Tier\n(Docker Container)" {
    COMPONENT "ASP.NET Core 8.0" {
        COMPONENT "Kestrel Web Server" as Kestrel
        COMPONENT "MVC Framework" as MVC
        COMPONENT "Dependency Injection" as DI
    }

    COMPONENT "Application Code" {
        COMPONENT "Controllers\n(*.dll)" as Controllers
        COMPONENT "Domain Logic\n(*.dll)" as Domain
        COMPONENT "Infrastructure\n(*.dll)" as Infra
    }

    DATABASE "In-Memory Database\nEF Core Provider" as DB
}

NODE "External Services Tier" {
    cloud "Identity Provider\n(OAuth 2.0)" as IDP
    cloud "Email Service\n(SMTP)" as SMTP
    cloud "Document Storage\n(optional)" as Storage
}

Browser -down-> Kestrel : HTTPS\nPort 5001
Kestrel -down-> MVC
MVC -down-> Controllers
Controllers -down-> Domain
Domain -down-> Infra
Infra -down-> DB

Controllers -right-> IDP : OAuth 2.0
Domain -right-> SMTP : Email Notifications
Infra -right-> Storage : File Storage

note right of "Application Tier\n(Docker Container)"
  **Deployment Options:**
  - Docker Container
  - Azure App Service
  - On-premises IIS

  **Environment Variables:**
  - ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT
  - ConnectionStrings
  - OAuth Settings
end note

note right of DB
  **Development:** In-Memory
  **Production:** SQL Server

  **Scalability:**
  Stateless API allows
  horizontal scaling
end note

@enduml